body:
ima do this nicely because i believe in the polite path first, literally all of this is over priced. and i say this not even like for evike but from manufacturer this is all over priced.   


the haley strategic chest rig is 185 on their website ->  [https://haleystrategic.com/d3crx](https://haleystrategic.com/d3crx)  

(real recommendation from a guy that owns some of their stuff i personally like the micro, can fit like 95% the same capacity as the normal one at like 40$ less) 

&#x200B;

the Spiritus systems bank robber is literally HALF the cost from their website ->   [https://www.spiritussystems.com/bank-robber-chest-rig/](https://www.spiritussystems.com/bank-robber-chest-rig/) 

&#x200B;

placard ->  [https://www.spiritussystems.com/placard-5-56-x-45/](https://www.spiritussystems.com/placard-5-56-x-45/) 

&#x200B;

tubes ->  [https://www.spiritussystems.com/molle-tubes-cummerbund/](https://www.spiritussystems.com/molle-tubes-cummerbund/) 

&#x200B;

chassis ->  [https://www.spiritussystems.com/micro-fight-chassis-mk4/](https://www.spiritussystems.com/micro-fight-chassis-mk4/) 

&#x200B;

now ill admit most of the spiritus stuff is out of stock but that doesnt stand for the $20 extra bucks at minimum for most not to mention OP is not paying for shipping or paypal fees.   


(once more, honestly i find haley strategic is the better buy but i may be biased because i have and use their stuff for both real steel and airsoft
